TITLE:: SuggestedValues
SUMMARY:: Prompted values for a parameter that still accepts another value of the same type.
CATEGORIES:: Control
RELATED:: Classes/Command, Classes/CommandPrompt, Classes/Parameter

DESCRIPTION::
TELETYPE::SuggestedValues:: is a constraint for a LINK::Classes/Parameter::. LINK::Classes/CommandPrompt:: offers the values as suggestions. The user can commit a highlighted suggestion, or type a different value of the parameter's type. A plain LINK::Classes/Collection:: constraint accepts only the listed values.

Each value's text form must be one token. An empty string, or a value whose text contains a space, is rejected. The values must also match the parameter type when the LINK::Classes/Parameter:: is created.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates a TELETYPE::SuggestedValues::.

ARGUMENT:: values
A LINK::Classes/Collection:: of suggested values, stored in iteration order. The collection must not be empty, and no entry may be CODE::nil::.

RETURNS::
A new TELETYPE::SuggestedValues:: instance.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: values
The suggested values, in the order they were given.

RETURNS::
An LINK::Classes/Array::. The array is a copy.

PRIVATE:: init
